## Epoch-cosim index file (pretraining monitor)

| | Path (under data root above) |
|---|---|
| Precomputed **structured similarity** panel remapped to train `FileAudioDataset` indices for `single_channel_all` | `metadata/epoch_cosim/structured_similarity_single_channel_all.npy` |

Built by `code/precompute_epoch_cosim_indices.py` from `build_structured_similarity_subset` (not the full train corpus). Not under `code/eval_results/` — that tree is for eval **outputs**; this is **dataset-derived metadata** for training.

---

## Recommended Data for `eval_fe_decoder.py`

For the 1k-train / 1k-eval setup (default `--max_eval_samples 2000`):

```bash
--eval_data_dir fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_10k
```

For a quick test (500 train / 500 eval):

```bash
--eval_data_dir fairseq/data/nova_data/single_channel_1k --max_eval_samples 1000
```

---

## Checkpoint Locations

| Description | Path |
|---|---|
| Compare single vs multi run | `/mnt5/noy/SpectralFM/checkpoints/runai/2026-03-10-compare-single-to-multi/` |
| Individual run dirs (best checkpoints) | `/mnt5/noy/SpectralFM/checkpoints/runai/<run-name>/checkpoint_best.pt` |

Both layouts are supported by `--checkpoint_dir` in `eval_fe_decoder.py` and `evaluation_runner.py`.
